---
import Platform from '../layouts/Platform.astro';
---
<Platform title="Featured project spot" description="Request one reviewed promotional feature for your project. $3 USD once, with clear submission and review steps.">
<header class="page-intro promo-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Project promotion</p><h1>Featured project spot</h1><p class="lede">Request one promotional feature for your project on Digivated and @digivatedx. Send a working link and a clear description after purchasing. Every request is reviewed before anything goes live.</p><p><strong>$3 USD once</strong> · One promotional request</p><div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://digivated.gumroad.com/l/digivated-promo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the $3 promo offer ↗</a><a class="button" href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">Already purchased? Submit your project</a></div><p class="quiet">Publication, traffic, engagement, and sales aren't guaranteed. Applicable taxes and purchase terms are shown on Gumroad.</p></header>
<section class="promo-steps" aria-labelledby="promo-steps-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2 id="promo-steps-title">Purchase, submit, and review.</h2></div><ol><li><div><h3>Purchase the promotional request</h3><p>Review the offer on Gumroad and pay $3 USD once. Keep your receipt so your submission can be matched to the purchase.</p></div></li><li><div><h3>Send your project</h3><p>Use the paid-promotion option on the project form. Include your receipt reference, project link, and description.</p><a href="/submit-project?promotion=1#project-form">Open the submission form →</a></div></li><li><div><h3>Wait for review</h3><p>Digivated checks the project and purchase before deciding whether to feature it. Purchasing doesn't instantly publish your project.</p></div></li></ol></section>
<section class="promo-details" aria-label="Other ways to submit"><div><h2>Included with Founding Membership</h2><p>Already a member? Your membership includes one reviewed feature request. You don't need to pay another $3 for that included request.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/founding-members#member-sign-in">Sign in to membership</a><a href="/submit-project?membership=1#project-form">Submit your included request →</a></div></div><div><h2>Just want a regular listing?</h2><p>You can submit your project for ordinary directory review for free. A free submission doesn't guarantee publication or a featured placement.</p><a class="button" href="/submit-project#project-form">Submit for free review</a></div></section>
<section class="promo-details" aria-label="Purchase support"><div><h2>Keep your receipt.</h2><p>Follow the delivery instructions in your Gumroad purchase. For purchase questions, reply to that receipt to contact the seller.</p></div><div><h2>Compare membership</h2><p>Founding Membership costs $5 once for the first 25 members. It includes full carousels, the full prompt packet, and one reviewed feature request.</p><a href="/founding-members">See everything membership includes →</a></div></section>
</Platform>

